<title>UK: UK's BTP remains confident of outlook.</title>
<headline>UK's BTP remains confident of outlook.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British speciality chemicals firm BTP Plc said on Thursday it continued to be positive on its outlook for the rest of the year despite further strengthening of the sterling.</p>
<p>&quot;The good start reported for the beginning of the year has continued through the first quarter and PCR acquisition completed in April is living up to its potential,&quot; chairman John Ketteley told the annual meeting of shareholders.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
</text>
